Current situation and opportunities of automotive PCB in 2021 News
How will PCB board manufacturers deal with it
At present, the biggest problem faced by every big PCB factory is not the price rise of raw materials, but the problem of how to grab this material. Because of the shortage of raw materials, each manufacturer needs to grab production capacity by placing orders in advance, and because of the prolonged cycle, they usually place orders in advance three months or even earlier.
From the perspective of the current structure and design, the technical barriers are not too big, mainly the processing of copper materials and the hole-to-hole technology, and there will be some gaps in the sophisticated products. At present, the domestic architecture and design have also entered a variety of fields, similar to the Taiwan products, which are expected to develop rapidly in the next 5 years.
China lags behind Taiwan, and Taiwan lags behind Europe and the United States. Most of the high-end application material research and development are in foreign countries, domestic will do some work to undertake, in the material part there is a long way to go, still need 10-20 years of efforts.
