Emerging markets such as 5G, artificial intelligence and Internet of vehicles also pose higher challenges to PCB. For PCB products in these emerging markets, the technology and raw materials of high-end high-frequency and high-speed PCB boards need to be comprehensively upgraded, and the technical barriers should be comprehensively upgraded.
CBA processing is a finished product of PCB bare board after SMT patch, DIP plug-in and PCBA test, quality inspection and assembly process, referred to as PCBA. The entrusting party delivers the processing project to the professional PCBA processing factory, and then waits for the finished product delivered by the processing factory according to the agreed time of both parties.
PCBA processing can effectively save the time cost of customers, the production process control to the professional PCBA processing plant, avoid waste in IC, resistor capacitor, audion and other electronic materials procurement bargaining and procurement time, at the same time save inventory costs, material inspection time, personnel expenses, effectively transfer the risk to the processing plant
PCBA processing project evaluation, customers in the design of products, there is a very important evaluation: manufacturability design, which is key to the quality control of the manufacturing process. Confirm the cooperation and sign the contract.
After the customer completes the product design, the customer will submit Gerber documents, BOM list and other engineering documents to the supplier, and the supplier will have special technical personnel to review and confirm, and evaluate the details of steel mesh printing, SMT process, plug-in process and so on. Material procurement, inspection and processing.
