FPC is developed by the United States during the space rocket technology development process.
The advantage of FPC:
It can be bent, wound and folded freely, arranged in accordance with the requirements of spatial layout, and moved and expanded arbitrarily in three-dimensional space, so as to achieve the integration of component assembly and wire connection;
The use of FPC can greatly reduce the volume and weight of electronic products, adapt to the development of electronic products towards high density, miniaturization, high reliability.
FPC will continue to innovate from four aspects in the future, mainly in:
Thickness. The FPC must be more flexible and thinner;
Bending is an inherent feature of FPC. In the future, FPC must be more flexible, more than 10,000 times.
At present, the price of FPC is much higher than THAT of PCB. If the price of FPC comes down, the market will be much broader.
Technological level. In order to meet various requirements, the process of FPC must be upgraded and the minimum aperture and line width/line spacing must meet higher requirements.
