Focus on Self-Motivation in Esports
Without English, You Don’t Get Far in Esport
In traditional sports, there is often historical clustering of people with specific characteristics.
And it doesn’t matter at all whether it’s a boy or a girl.
For example, karting, horse riding, and other more exclusive sports can be very expensive in initial costs and maintenance. However, if you look at the mass of all traditional sports, the initial purchase costs are far less than what you would have if you want to become a professional player in Esports.
