Throughout its history, the logo was changing until a final result was obtained. At first glance we can see that what stands out the most is its huge round typography, these strokes not only evoke the round shape of the donuts, which is the main element, but also all the outlines that they have designed for the other elements are also.
Although it may not seem like it at first glance, the logo of the American multinational company that manufactures and sells coffee is also designed by round typefaces, or at least the designer has tried to offer a friendly character to its design.
Well, you can already get an idea that it is possible and it is also functional.
Typography VAG Rounded, is a sans-serif and geometric typeface and was designed neither more nor less for the company itself. It is currently part of Adobe and has also been featured on billboards, advertisements, and even more logos.
As you have seen, round fonts have been used in various designs for years. In addition to their shape, they also provide a high range of readability that makes them very functional in each of the projects in which it intervenes.
