Signage: what is it?
The signage is defined as one of the important branches that make up graphic design.
What is great? Well, thanks to this invention, many people with hearing problems can communicate and move around a certain environment without any problem.
Currently there are many characteristics that bring together this type of element, but only the most basic ones are the ones that fully describe signage.
They are designed with each of the features in the environment. For example, we can find the famous sign that It leads us to a certain parking lot or vehicle parking area, and it has been designed with all the characteristics of this environment so that the individual can identify it without any problem.
In short, they are elements that combine well when creating a certain brand.
Signage in different environments
Hotels are similar to hospitals, but perhaps without fewer chemicals. The signs that are usually seen represented in hotels, they serve so that the client is at all times located and guided throughout the establishment.
These are some of the resources that must always be highly clear and informed.
