In short, human beings also communicate through signals that help us locate and direct ourselves in a much more comfortable way. So much so that, without it, we would be complete individuals finding ourselves and moving about in the same environment.
Hospitals are centers of great importance for humanity, moreover, andIt is also necessary to inform patients or people who access, that entry to different areas of the hospital cannot be allowed for the safety of each of the individuals who are there. Another example is the signs that warn of certain radiations, or of chemical elements that, if not treated properly, can become toxins or highly toxic products.
There are hotels that occupy large spaces, that are very spacious and that contain numerous rooms. Imagine if none of these signs existed, each person would walk lost or even return to the point through which they have already passed, it would be the closest thing to the maze of Alice in Wonderland.
Airports are places where the amplitude is enormous, so much so that they are divided by different floors or sections. It is important that all the people who share the same space, beyond the plane, they also know where to go at all times to satisfy their primary needs: cafeterias, restaurants, services, boarding area, etc.
