Well, In this post we are going to travel to a time of cowboys and gunmen, as if it were an old western movie. We are going to explain what western typography is and what uses or characteristics it has.
Category movies or western genre, is a classic American genre that is very focused on spaces or places belonging to the old west where characters we know as cowboys or Indians intervene. This genre emerged in the XNUMXth century, where it was influenced by some political, social or demographic changes of the time.
This type of genre has been maintained throughout the history of cinema, even today, these types of films continue to be seen. His decline arose in the 70s and it was not until the 90s when these types of movies went viral again., where it should be noted that, at first they were seen in black and white and it was not until later when they began to be seen in color.
Here are some examples of the best western typefaces.
Westwood is one of the typefaces that are characterized by being designed through a free and adventurous style that will offer you all the animated and cinematographic character you need to your designs.
This font is also characterized by including other interesting aspects such as the use of upper and lower case letters, some punctuation marks and international characters that can help some of your designs. Without a doubt, a wonderful font that can offer your designs a touch of the pure old west.
Addison is a typeface that is characterized by being modern and with a certain traditional aspect and design, which can offer you all the character you need for your designs. In addition, it also has a lot of creativity and personality, so it stands out very well from other designs and does not go unnoticed.
It is a font that has been designed so that you can use it in posters, big headlines or even in editorial design as a possible layout for a magazine or newspaper.
For what its character expresses, it should be noted that its worn design combines very well with old-fashioned designs. This font includes other elements that may interest you, such as basic Latin characters or others such as symbols, numbers and even many pictograms that can help you better display information.
It is the most modern and up-to-date western typeface of all the ones we have shown you. Its design is spectacular and will also leave you speechless as it maintains all the personality of the old west era.
Its appearance, much more technological and current than retro or vintage, means that it can be used for much more renewed projects but with the desire to maintain that characteristic air of the American action genre. Without a doubt, if you are looking for news with the old west, this can also be a perfect option.
It is a font that combines different aspects, it is much more demure than other fonts that we have shown you, but it is perfect to combine it in brand design. It is without a doubt the perfect design for a corporate identity project where a font of this style is required.
We hope you have learned more about the world of fonts, especially this type of design. We also hope that some of the fonts that we have shown you will help you to increase your creativity in the projects you carry out.
