Our solar system is made up of a main star known as the sun. It is thanks to the sun that the planet earth can have enough energy in the form of light and heat.
For this reason, we are going to dedicate this article to tell you what the sun is, what its characteristics are and what functions it fulfills both in the universe and our planet.
3 Internal structure of the sun
Keep in mind that it is the most important celestial body for us and other creatures to survive. There are many substances that make up the sun, and it is estimated that as it grows, they begin to agglomerate under the action of gravity.
