4 Hydrogen distribution in Spain
Dhamma Energy started operations in France and Spain more than a decade ago, where it developed its first solar projects. Subsequently, Dhamma Energy increased its activities in France, where it built its first own solar park.
Over the years, with the experience they have gained, they have become an independent leader in the development of photovoltaic power plants and solar energy production. As developers, builders, operators and investors of photovoltaic plants, they cover the entire life cycle of the project: from the search for the land to the maintenance and management of the photovoltaic park.
They are involved in the entire life cycle of the project and supervise the start-up of solar power plants and once they reach the commercialization stage, they develop and operate these projects.
They currently have a range of solar power plants in operation, including medium and large ground-mounted plants, as well as rooftop plants, located mainly in France.
