It is a next generation smart residential photovoltaic solution that Huawei has invented. This revolutionary idea emphasizes smart and innovative technologies in order to provide the simplest installation standards and the highest safety and long-term operability.
Huawei launched the next-generation residential smart photovoltaic solution "FusionSolar", emphasizing innovative smart technology, providing the simplest installation standards, highest security and long-term operability, and the goal is 100% domestic self-consumption.
A system designed for professional homeowners and installers. Residential installers must provide homeowners with a powerful and future-oriented self-consumption system that maintains high efficiency, flexibility and rapid installation, and provides smart solutions that meet user and customer service needs, such as remote diagnostics of failures, to achieve more.
In the new residential self-consumption system, the photovoltaic energy generated by solar panels meets the demand for electricity of the home during the day, and the remaining energy generated is used to charge the battery and then discharged to meet the maximum demand for electricity. Demand for electricity at night or during the day.
Smart photovoltaic battery optimizer: 99,5% efficiency. Leave more panels on each ceiling for higher system performance.
Smart photovoltaic cells security: communicate with the optimizer through MBUS. Supports real-time monitoring and management modules.
Each battery pack has a built-in power optimizer to support independent charge and discharge management. The Fusion Solar system provides an optional photovoltaic power optimizer that can limit residential shade problems and enable the use of photovoltaic systems to effectively deploy complex mixed-direction roofs.
The smart photovoltaic management system provides real-time energy flow and energy balance readings, as well as performance management of photovoltaic panels.
It is a totally clean energy that helps to reduce the carbon footprint significantly. Thanks to its use we avoid the generation of greenhouse gases and we do not pollute during their generation or during their use.
