Bad news for those who were waiting for the new Apple Watch: one of the new functions that were expected in the model that will arrive after this summer could be delayed again. The reason?
The problems that Apple has experienced when measuring body temperature have to do with the fact that the temperature of the skin varies rapidly depending on the ambient temperature. Since Apple cannot measure core temperature (the "good"), this functionality was based on measuring skin temperature and applying algorithms so that, depending on different factors, such as environmental temperature, the real temperature could be estimated.
